OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_LemonadeAsk::
	.string "LEMONADE, ice cold, 200.\n"
	.string "Town charges 350. Want one?$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_LemonadeThanks::
	.string "Shelly: Drink it before it goes\n"
	.string "warm, mind.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_LemonadeNo::
	.string "Shelly: Suit yourself. It is only\n"
	.string "going to get hotter.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_LemonadeBroke::
	.string "Shelly: Come back when you have\n"
	.string "the coins, love.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_LemonadeFull::
	.string "Shelly: You have nowhere to put it!$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_CurioIntro::
	.string "I only sell what the tide brings\n"
	.string "in. Let me see what I have...$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_CurioOffer::
	.string "A {STR_VAR_1}! That is a fine one.\p"
	.string "{STR_VAR_2} and it is yours.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_CurioThanks::
	.string "Mind the sharp edge. Come back at\n"
	.string "low tide.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_CurioNo::
	.string "It will be gone by this evening,\n"
	.string "you know.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_CurioBroke::
	.string "No coins, no curio. Them is the\n"
	.string "rules of the beach.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_CurioFull::
	.string "You are carrying too much already!$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_BaitAsk::
	.string "No rod? You cannot enter the DERBY\n"
	.string "without one.\p"
	.string "OLD ROD, 300. Go on.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_BaitThanks::
	.string "It has caught a winner before. Not\n"
	.string "for me, mind.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_BaitHasRod::
	.string "Already tooled up, I see. The DERBY\n"
	.string "judge is down by the jetty.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_BaitNo::
	.string "Suit yourself. Watching is free.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_BaitBroke::
	.string "Not even 300? Try the DERBY's\n"
	.string "consolation prize, that pays.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbyRules::
	.string "The MANDARIN FISHING DERBY, young\n"
	.string "one. The rules are short.\p"
	.string "Fish these waters. Bring me one\n"
	.string "POKeMON. I will judge it.\p"
	.string "It must have been hooked here, in\n"
	.string "MANDARIN waters. I can tell.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbyBest::
	.string "Your best so far scored {STR_VAR_3}.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbyAsk::
	.string "Do you have something to show me?$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbyWeighIn::
	.string "Let me see... {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
	.string "Hmm. I make that {STR_VAR_2} points.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbyGrand::
	.string "{STR_VAR_2}! In forty years I have\n"
	.string "written that number twice.\p"
	.string "The DERBY has a standing prize for\n"
	.string "a catch like that. Take it.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbyFirstText::
	.string "First class. The jetty regulars\n"
	.string "will be sour about this.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbySecondText::
	.string "A respectable catch. Not a winner,\n"
	.string "but respectable.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbyThirdText::
	.string "Modest. The sea was not generous\n"
	.string "to you today.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbyConsolationText::
	.string "Everyone goes home with something.\n"
	.string "Even you.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbyNothing::
	.string "There is nothing in that slot.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbyEggText::
	.string "An EGG. I admire the nerve.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbyElsewhereText::
	.string "This was never hooked here. I have\n"
	.string "judged this DERBY for forty years;\l"
	.string "do not try it on with me.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbyDryLandText::
	.string "That has never been in the water in\n"
	.string "its life. A WATER type, please.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbyLaterText::
	.string "The jetty is free all day. Go and\n"
	.string "catch something.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_BaitSign::
	.string "BAIT SHACK\n"
	.string "Rods, bait, and bad advice.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_CurioSign::
	.string "THE TIDE LINE\n"
	.string "Whatever the sea left this morning.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_DerbySign::
	.string "THE MANDARIN FISHING DERBY\n"
	.string "Entries judged at the jetty.\l"
	.string "Hooked in MANDARIN waters only.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_Landlady::
	.string "Villa four is free next week if\n"
	.string "you fancy it.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_LemonadeSign::
	.string "SHELLY'S LEMONADE\n"
	.string "Cheaper than town. Always has been.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_Lifeguard::
	.string "Past the jetty the current runs\n"
	.string "hard. Surf it if you must, but\l"
	.string "keep your POKeMON close.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OldSalt::
	.string "Sixty years I have fished off this\n"
	.string "jetty. The sea still surprises me.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_Sandcastle::
	.string "My sandcastle has a moat AND a\n"
	.string "drawbridge. Do not step on it!$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_Sunbather::
	.string "Half of MANDARIN SOUTH comes out\n"
	.string "here the moment the sun is up.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_Tourist::
	.string "There is nothing out here but sand\n"
	.string "and water, and that is the point.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_Town::
	.string "MANDARIN SOUTH BEACH\n"
	.string "Through the gap and you are back\l"
	.string "in the city.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_VillaSign::
	.string "BEACH VILLAS 1 TO 4\n"
	.string "Quiet, please. People are asleep.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeNerissaIntro::
	.string "The water is warmer on this side\n"
	.string "of the island. Come in!$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeNerissaDefeat::
	.string "Brrr! Out, out!$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeNerissaPostBattle::
	.string "My POKeMON swim out past the\n"
	.string "jetty every morning.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeCoyIntro::
	.string "You are a long way from the\n"
	.string "shore, friend.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeCoyDefeat::
	.string "Out of my depth.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeCoyPostBattle::
	.string "Watch the current past the jetty.\n"
	.string "It will carry you off.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeMarlinIntro::
	.string "Shh. No -- too late, you have\n"
	.string "scared them. Battle me instead.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeMarlinDefeat::
	.string "Reeled in.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeMarlinPostBattle::
	.string "I have won the DERBY twice. Never\n"
	.string "with anything I expected.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeCoralIntro::
	.string "Do not kick sand on my towel.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeCoralDefeat::
	.string "My hair! My hair!$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeCoralPostBattle::
	.string "I only came out here to read.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangePiaIntro::
	.string "We are having a picnic. You can\n"
	.string "have a battle.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangePiaDefeat::
	.string "No pudding for me, then.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangePiaPostBattle::
	.string "The lemonade stand is the cheapest\n"
	.string "on the islands. Go on.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeBosunIntro::
	.string "Off the boat an hour and already\n"
	.string "spoiling for a scrap.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeBosunDefeat::
	.string "Back to the galley.$"

OrangeIslands_Mandarin_South_Beach_Text_OrangeBosunPostBattle::
	.string "We put in here for water. I stayed\n"
	.string "for the lemonade.$"

